{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moebius: Endless Dream</strong> is a first-person escape room puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the game with keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a man named <strong>Nicholas</strong>, exploring a sealed and unfamiliar space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a strange room with no memory of who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you must uncover an <strong>8-letter English key</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the room, search for clues, and examine them through your <strong>inventory</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather information and piece together the key to make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the truth</strong> that awaits you.<br>Recover the memories you\u2019ve lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings await, based on your final decision: <strong>Atonement</strong> or <strong>Oblivion</strong>.<br>How far can you run... from yourself?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Atonement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505310/c5d81a1c033b4b35802564308a28d16606c9b4f3.jpg"},{"name":"Oblivion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505310/f5861cbf922994b1ff9c0c1cad3dc779789b24c4.jpg"},{"name":"Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505310/cec08293b4591bc7765b403ae80371d9666b69c8.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505310?t=1751528926","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505310?t=1751528926","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505310/eca8101e847b71a5dad5eeb79ad64747180cb61e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17515